    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to her but i hate seeing that look in her eyes. that tired, exhausted look. like she's mourning the person i used to be while she's still trying to take care of me. it just feels so unfair that her whole life has to revolve around my decline. sometimes i just think... if i wasn't here, she could finally just breathe again. she could actually live her life instead of just managing my mess.",
